#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A Japanese dictionary is downloaded for furigana and romaji readings. This "
"setting also increases resource usage."
msgstr ""
"Kamus bahasa Jepang akan diunduh untuk menampilkan bacaan furigana dan "
"romaji. Pengaturan ini dapat meningkatkan penggunaan sumber daya perangkat."

msgid ""
"Approving gives this device access to your profile and saved source logins."
msgstr ""
"Dengan menyetujui, perangkat ini bisa mengakses profil dan informasi masuk "
"sumber yang tersimpan."

msgid ""
"Backup file may contain sensitive information. Do you want to set a password?"
msgstr ""
"File cadangan mungkin berisi informasi sensitif. Ingin menambahkan kata "
"sandi?"

msgid ""
"Backup restored with {entries} skipped playlist entries and {listens} "
"skipped listens."
msgstr ""
"Cadangan dipulihkan dengan {entries} playlist dan {listens} riwayat "
"pemutaran dilewati."

msgid ""
"Connecting an existing profile will remove all data in this device, do you "
"really want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Menghubungkan profil yang sudah ada akan menghapus semua data di perangkat "
"ini, Anda yakin ingin melanjutkan?"

msgid ""
"Devices using Rufin Connect are no longer compatible. Please update Rufin."
msgstr ""
"Perangkat yang menggunakan Rufin Connect tidak kompatibel lagi. Silahkan "
"memperbarui Rufin."

msgid ""
"Do you want to cache all lyrics automatically? You can also enable this from "
"Preferences -> Storage"
msgstr ""
"Apakah anda ingin menyimpan lirik secara otomatis? Anda juga bisa "
"mengaktifkan ini dari menu Preferensi -> Penyimpanan"

msgid ""
"Downloads from this source will be removed, and automatic rules will be "
"turned off"
msgstr ""
"Unduhan dari sumber ini akan dihapus, dan aturan otomatis akan dimatikan"

msgid ""
"GNU FM, Maloja and other Last.fm-style servers. On Maloja, the password is "
"an API key."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If Discord is not installed as a flatpak, you need to give socket access to "
"Rufin. If it is installed as a flatpak, this is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Jika Discord tidak diinstal sebagai Flatpak, Anda perlu memberikan akses "
"socket kepada Rufin. Jika diinstal sebagai Flatpak, langkah ini tidak "
"diperlukan."

msgid ""
"List shared folders on this server using the entered credentials or guest "
"access"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Listens from Rufin, ListenBrainz or Last.fm, or play counts from other "
"players"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Logs have secrets and absolute folder paths redacted, but you may still want "
"to review the logs before sharing them"
msgstr ""
"Data sensitif dan jalur folder lengkap dalam log telah disamarkan, tetapi "
"Anda sebaiknya tetap memeriksa log sebelum membagikannya"

msgid "No results ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"
msgstr "Tidak ada hasil ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"

msgid ""
"No secret service found. Rufin will use a file to store its credentials. "
"Cancelling will not save credentials at all."
msgstr ""
"Layanan Secret Service tidak ditemukan, Rufin akan menggunakan file untuk "
"menyimpan kredensialnya. Jika dibatalkan kredensial tidak akan disimpan sama "
"sekali."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"No secret service found. You might have a secret service but the portal can "
"be broken, you can check {link_start}this issue{link_end} to fix it, "
"otherwise Rufin will use a file to store its credentials. Cancelling will "
"not save credentials at all."
msgstr ""
"Layanan Secret Service tidak ditemukan. Mungkin Anda punya Secret Service, "
"tetapi Portal-nya rusak, Anda dapat memeriksa {link_start}masalah "
"ini{link_end} untuk memperbaikinya. Jika tidak, Rufin akan menggunakan file "
"untuk menyimpan kredensialnya. Jika dibatalkan kredensial tidak akan "
"disimpan sama sekali."

msgid ""
"Only downloads from this rule will be deleted. Shared and manual downloads "
"stay"
msgstr ""
"Hanya unduhan dari aturan ini yang akan dihapus. Unduhan bersama dan manual "
"tidak akan dihapus"

msgid ""
"Only imports the tracks as a playlist, does not watch the folder for changes."
msgstr ""
"Hanya mengimpor lagu sebagai playlist dan tidak memantau perubahan pada "
"folder."

msgid ""
"Open Rufin Connect on another device, connect via Join button or by copying "
"invitation code"
msgstr ""
"Buka Rufin Connect di perangkat lain, hubungkan melalui tombol Gabung atau "
"dengan menyalin code undangan"

msgid ""
"Relative paths start at the music folder or source URL. Local paths can also "
"be absolute."
msgstr ""
"Jalur relatif dimulai dari folder musik atau URL sumber. Jalur lokal juga "
"bisa absolut."

msgid ""
"Remove all Rufin data and settings except saved connections and credentials? "
"Rufin will restart after clearing the data."
msgstr ""
"Hapus semua data dan pengaturan Rufin kecuali koneksi tersimpan dan "
"kredensial? Rufin akan dimulai ulang setelah data dihapus."

msgid ""
"Remove all Rufin data, settings and saved logins? Rufin will restart after "
"clearing the data."
msgstr ""
"Hapus semua data, pengaturan dan informasi masuk tersimpan Rufin? Rufin akan "
"dimulai ulang setelah data dihapus."

msgid ""
"Remove everything Rufin keeps about Local, including its favorites, ratings "
"and lyrics? Your music files will not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Hapus semua yang disimpan Rufin tentang Lokal, termasuk favorit, penilaian, "
"dan lirik? File musik Anda tidak akan dihapus."

msgid ""
"Remove everything Rufin keeps about {name}, including its favorites, ratings "
"and lyrics?"
msgstr ""
"Hapus semua yang Rufin simpan tentang {name}, termasuk favorit, penilaian "
"dan lirik?"

msgid ""
"Replace the selected contents and remove these configured sources?\n"
"{sources}\n"
"Their retained user state and saved logins will remain unless selected."
msgstr ""
"Ganti konten yang dipilih dan hapus sumber yang telah diatur berikut?\n"
"{sources}\n"
"Data pengguna dan informasi masuk tetap disimpan kecuali dipilih untuk "
"dihapus."

msgid ""
"Replace the selected contents with this backup? Local folder permissions may "
"need to be selected again."
msgstr ""
"Ganti isi yang dipilih dengan cadangan ini? izin folder local mungkin perlu "
"dipilih ulang."

msgid ""
"Route server media through this device instead of sharing provider URLs with "
"the renderer"
msgstr ""
"Putar media server lewat perangkat ini, bukan membagikan alamat URL penyedia "
"ke perangkat pemutar"

msgid ""
"Rufin asks these services about the music you play. All of this can be "
"changed later in Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Rufin bertanya ke layanan-layanan ini tentang musik yang diputar. Semuanya "
"bisa diubah nanti di Preferensi."

msgid ""
"Rufin asks these services about the music you play. All of this can be "
"changed later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Rufin bertanya ke layanan-layanan ini tentang musik yang diputar. Semuanya "
"bisa diubah nanti di Pengaturan."

msgid ""
"Rufin will calculate the missing EBU R128 metadata for the whole library. "
"This can use significant CPU, battery, and network bandwidth for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Rufin akan menghitung metadata EBU R128 yang belum ada untuk seluruh "
"pustaka. Proses ini bisa memakai CPU, baterai, dan data internet dalam "
"jangka waktu lama."

msgid ""
"Some changes were saved. Close this editor and reopen it to review the "
"result."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa perubahan sudah disimpan. Tutup editor ini lalu buka lagi untuk "
"memeriksa hasilnya."

msgid ""
"Temporary library storage is in use. Changes may be lost when Rufin closes."
msgstr ""
"Penyimpanan pustaka sementara sedang digunakan. Perubahan bisa hilang saat "
"Rufin ditutup."

msgid ""
"Thank you for trying out Rufin! If you have problems or suggestions, please "
"open an issue in Github."
msgstr ""
"Terima kasih sudah mencoba Rufin! jika ada masalah atau saran, silahkan buka "
"laporan di Github."

msgid ""
"This is a fallback artwork Rufin uses, do you want to set this as the item "
"artwork?"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah sampul pengganti yang digunakan Rufin. Apakah Anda ingin "
"menjadikannya sampul untuk item ini?"

msgid ""
"This is not supported natively by this source, but Rufin can show partial "
"stars and then round them up for the source"
msgstr ""
"Sumber ini tidak mendukung hal ini secara bawaan, tetapi Rufin dapat "
"menampilkan setengah bintang lalu membulatkannya ke atas untuk sumber ini"

msgid ""
"This is owned by Rufin. It can include entries from all configured sources "
"but it is not synced to remotes."
msgstr ""
"Ini dikelola oleh Rufin, Ini dapat berisi entri dari semua sumber yang "
"telang diatur tetapi tidak disinkronkan ke layanan online."

msgid ""
"This will log you out and clear your secrets including API ones. Your app "
"cache is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Ini akan membuat Anda keluar dari akun dan menghapus data sensitif, termasuk "
"kunci API. Cache aplikasi Anda tidak akan diubah."

msgid ""
"This will overwrite your lyrics file with what Rufin fetched, it may be a "
"better experience to use a dedicated program or plugin to fetch lyrics "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Ini akan menimpa file lirik Anda dengan lirik yang diambil Rufin, Anda "
"mungkin mendapatkan hasil yang lebih baik dengan menggunakan program atau "
"plugin khusus untuk mengambil lirik."

msgid ""
"Track evens out every song, while Album preserves the intended differences "
"within each album"
msgstr ""
"Opsi Lagu membuat semua lagu terdengar sama rata, sedangkan Album menjaga "
"perbedaan volume asli di setiap album"

msgid ""
"You have set Rufin to automatically download your entire library. This can "
"use a lot of data. Do you confirm?"
msgstr ""
"Anda mengatur Rufin untuk mengunduh seluruh pustaka Anda secara otomatis. "
"Ini bisa memakan banyak data internet. Apakah anda yakin?"

msgid ""
"You will need to reconnect through the clients you use with the new API key."
msgstr ""
"Anda perlu menghubungkan ulang lewat aplikasi yang Anda gunakan menggunakan "
"kunci API baru."

